Overlay patch 0018: touch scrolling for the SoH menu.
The shell queues finger scroll deltas (overlay 0013 exports); the menu's
scrollable children consume them when the finger is horizontally inside
the child window. Mouse-free, so no hover tooltips and no slider
side-effects (device feedback: swipes read as hover and even adjusted
sliders via wheel). Patches the three BeginChild sites (sidebar, search
section, per-column sections) in Menu.cpp; __IOS__-only.

